# Hand-downloaded source data, excluded by default and re-included per source.
# `data/*` rather than `data/` on purpose: git cannot re-include anything inside an
# excluded *directory*, so excluding the contents is what makes the exceptions
# below possible at all. The reasoning for each line is in data/LICENCES.md.
# A trailing `#` is not a comment in this file — only a line-leading one is — so
# these annotations sit on their own lines. Putting them after the pattern turns
# the whole line into a literal that matches nothing, silently.
data/*
!data/LICENCES.md
# World Bank Open Data, CC BY 4.0
!data/worldbank/
# US Bureau of Labor Statistics, public domain
!data/us_labor/

# Editorial rather than published: which posts are planned, and how their titles
# were chosen. Not secret, but not part of the record either.
analysis/
docs/CONTENT_BACKLOG.md
